  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Handing the original back\n\nEvery dashboard row links here. The stored path is checked to be inside the allowed storage area **before** the file is read, and a missing file answers cleanly instead of erroring the run.\n\nThis is the smallest workflow here and the one that matters most: it is why nobody has to take an extracted date on trust. The document that produced it is one click away.",
        "height": 620,
        "width": 1420,
        "color": 4
      },
